AUTHORITY HIERARCHY:
┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ 1. __docs__/constitution/ (10 Laws)     │ ← PRODUCT AUTHORITY (The North Star)
│    - 8 governance documents              │
│    - Founder-only modification           │
├─────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ 2. .cascade/rules/ (MANDATORY)          │ ← CODE AUTHORITY (Cannot override)
│    - 20 security rules                   │
│    - Doc organization rules              │
│    - Zero tolerance enforcement          │
├─────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ 3. .windsurf/rules/ (ENFORCEMENT)       │ ← DOMAIN AUTHORITY
│    - Menu output constitution            │
├─────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ 4. OWASP Top 10 Standards               │ ← Industry Requirements
├─────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ 5. __docs__/security/ (Guides)          │ ← Implementation How-To
├─────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ 6. IDE_PROMPTS/ (Process)               │ ← Development Pipeline
├─────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ 7. .windsurf/workflows/ (Automation)    │ ← Slash Commands
├─────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ 8. Cascade Memories (Context)           │ ← Past Work & Preferences
└─────────────────────────────────────────┘

KEY DIFFERENCE:
- Constitution = PRODUCT LAW (what MenuList IS and ISN'T)
- Rules = CODE LAW (enforced, no exceptions)
- Workflows = PROCESS AUTOMATION (slash commands, flexible)
